<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico assigns secondary credits.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico assigns secondary credits.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Banco de Mexico completed two credit auctions in the secondary market on Monday.</p>
<p>CREDIT AUCTIONS   TERMS   AVERAGES</p>
<p>1.506 bln pesos  11 days  24.71 1.505 bln pesos   1 day   23.84</p>
<p>- Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9500</p>
